    "S1_06": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S1_06.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "那是我的声音。‘妈，我没事’是我下晚班打电话常说的，‘灯别关’听着像我小时候……剩下的话，我一时想不起来。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S2_07": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S2_07.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "别动发送键。拿笔抄在簿子上，一字不许改。抄完再把屏幕上的字清掉。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S2_08": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S2_08.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "苏建国。前天半夜里接进来的，昨天下午人从城南水闸捞出来了。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S3_09": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S3_09.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "青禾姐，‘他手上有铁锈味’……这不是上个月在开水房你跟我说的吗？你说周牧手上有铁锈味，闻着踏实。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S3_10": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S3_10.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "周牧上周刚转了正式工，他母亲私下把存折塞给了他。他今天在楼下要说什么，我原本心里一清二楚。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S4_11": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S4_11.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "禾禾！下夜班饿了吧？今天顶棚风大，我下车间顺路……",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S4_12": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S4_12.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "周牧，我刚下夜班，台里还有点事。等忙完，我找你。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S5_13": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S5_13.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "……纸条上写得清清楚楚！建国说他没喝酒！七年前我家晚晚也是在这栋楼里当话务员跑丢的！你们今天必须给我查清楚！",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S5_14": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S5_14.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "青禾姐，真不怪我。前天半夜那是空号，声音哑得不行，可真的太像苏叔了。我当时以为他喝多了，我才好心转给周阿姨的。谁能想到，昨天人就在水闸没了？我害怕，青禾姐，这事不能跟我转的那条有关吧？",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S5_15": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S5_15.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "小雯，你顺便帮我瞅一眼，我那根玳瑁发卡是不是掉在更衣室三号柜后面了？",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S5_16": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S5_16.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "我没有收到任何指令，是我自己的嘴，在最自然的一刻，把第三句话吐了出来。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S6_17": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S6_17.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "青禾，这时候拿木棍顶门干什么？下班那会儿周牧往咱家座机打了电话，问你是不是哪儿不舒服，听着急得不行。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S6_18": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S6_18.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "妈，夜里要是外头有动静或者有人敲门，你别一个人去开，先叫我。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S6_19": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S6_19.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "妈……我小时候，是不是爱说‘灯别关’？",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S6_20": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S6_20.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "怎么突然翻这旧账。那年腊月，你才六岁。你爸卷着铺盖走的那晚，屋里黑透了。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S6_21": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S6_21.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "你在门边死死拽着门框不撒手，哭得上气不接下气。就那一句话，‘灯别关’，翻来覆去喊了整整一夜。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S6_22": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S6_22.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "‘灯别关’是我六岁的惊恐，‘铁锈味’也是我说过的旧话。可开头那声‘是他’……我根本不知道是从哪儿来的。",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S7_23": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S7_23.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "小雯？",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
      "speech_start": null,
      "speech_end": null,
      "speech_boundary_method": null,
      "caption_method": null,
      "captions": []
    },
    "S7_24": {
      "kind": "voice",
      "path": "assets/voice/S7_24.wav",
      "drive_file_id": null,
      "sha256": null,
      "confirmed": false,
      "provenance": "subscription_api_new",
      "authorized_for_this_draft": true,
      "source_text": "青禾姐……3点09分……那个空号又打进来了！还是你的声音！前面全没变……可最后一句、最后一句变了！罗姐刚才把登记本夺过去了！",
      "source_text_verified": false,
      "duration_method": null,
      "duration_seconds": null,
      "ffprobe": null,
